# Motion & Haptics

## Motion
- Order: static aesthetics → visual states → interaction → motion → haptics → sound (last).
- All motion interruptible and causal.
- Respect `animateMotionAsState` / system Reduce Motion settings.
- Pause off-screen; no decorative infinite loops at scale.
- Structural: Compose Animation APIs. Closed loops: Lottie. Complex interactive: Rive (evaluate).
- Light/material: `graphicsLayer`, `Brush`, Canvas, selective shaders with fallback.
- Budgets: `docs/design/PERFORMANCE_VISUAL_BUDGETS.md`, `docs/design/MOTION_SYSTEM.md`.

## Haptics
- Semantic families only: Contact, Selection, Snap, Confirmation, Warning, Error, Protection, Emergency.
- Not every tap vibrates. Prefer system-defined effects.
- Reference: `docs/design/HAPTICS_SYSTEM.md`.
